{"id":"wikibooks:corn-dogs","verdict":"keep","recipes":[{"source":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook%3ACorn_Dogs","status":"fixed","reason":"Temperature invocation lost fryer setting","ingredients":["⅔ cup (160 g) corn meal","⅓ cup (60 g) flour","1 teaspoon salt","½ cup (120 ml) milk","1 egg, beaten","2 tablespoon vegetable oil","8–10 hot dogs"],"steps":["Preheat deep fat fryer to 375°F (190°C).","Combine corn meal, flour, and salt. Add milk, egg, and oil; mix well.","Insert a wooden skewer into one end of each hot dog.","Coat with flour, then coat with corn meal mixture.","Fry a few at a time in deep hot oil until golden brown."]}]}
